##
#
# Performance and scaling measurements for the 3D Mach 3 flow past a
# cylinder, Section 5, Tables 2-6 and Figure 7 of [1].
#
# The configuration is the same as in 2021-MK-5-mach3_cylinder-3d.prm
# (uniform Mach 3 flow past a cylinder of diameter 0.5 in the channel [0,4]
# x [-1,1] x [-1,1]) but without any output, and the simulation is stopped
# after a fixed number of time steps. The scheme uses the third-order SSP
# Runge-Kutta method (ssprk 33) discussed in Section 3.6 of [1].
#
# The chosen refinement level 6 corresponds to the 29M gridpoints used for
# the node-level measurements of Tables 2-6 (434 time steps, i.e., 1302
# Runge-Kutta stages, on 80 Cascade Lake cores). For the scaling study of
# Figure 7 increase the refinement level to 7, 8, and 9 (228M, 1.8B, and
# 15B gridpoints); [1] uses between 434 and 1732 time steps for these runs.
# The coarse mesh (208 gridpoints) is the one of [1]; this is a
# reconstruction of the original configuration.
#
# [1] M. Maier, M. Kronbichler. Efficient parallel 3D computation of the
#     compressible Euler equations with an invariant-domain preserving
#     second-order finite-element scheme. ACM Trans. Parallel Comput.,
#     8(3):16:1-30, 2021. DOI 10.1145/3470637, arXiv:2007.00094
#
##

subsection A - Scheduler
  set basename          = mach3-cylinder-3d-scaling

  set tasks             =

  set final time        = 5.00
  set max cycles        = 434
  set timer granularity = 5.00
end


subsection B - Equation
  set dimension = 3
  set equation  = euler
  set gamma     = 1.4
end


subsection C - Discretization
  set geometry            = cylinder

  set mesh refinement     = 6

  subsection cylinder
    set height          = 2
    set length          = 4
    set object diameter = 0.5
    set object position = 0.6
  end
end


subsection E - InitialValues
  set configuration = uniform

  set direction     = 1, 0, 0
  set position      = 1, 0, 0

  set perturbation  = 0

  subsection uniform
    set primitive state = 1.4, 3, 1
  end
end


subsection H - TimeIntegrator
  set cfl min               = 0.90
  set cfl max               = 0.90
  set cfl recovery strategy = none

  set time stepping scheme  = ssprk 33
end
